WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.119
ARMv8-A instruction data flow
A conceptual animation follows load, add, and store operations. It is not a cycle-accurate processor
model.

2
00:00:15.219 --> 00:00:29.126
Registers, arithmetic, and memory
The diagram separates register values, the integer ALU, and memory addresses.

3
00:00:29.226 --> 00:00:43.131
Follow the instruction operands
LDR, ADD, and STR connect the instruction text to the changing register and memory values.

4
00:00:43.231 --> 00:00:56.983
Check the final state
The example loads 42, adds 7, and stores 49. The film explains architectural data flow rather than
physical timing.
